various systems to provide comprehensive

5
00:00:23,743 --> 00:00:28,175
monitoring capabilities.

6
00:00:30,175 --> 00:00:34,663
In the pull model, Prometheus actively
scrapes targets without needing agents on

7
00:00:34,663 --> 00:00:39,151
those systems. Targets expose their
metrics at specific endpoints, allowing

8
00:00:39,151 --> 00:00:43,639
Prometheus to collect data centrally. This
