16
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:31,363
The pull model can introduce network
overhead and scaling challenges when

17
00:01:31,363 --> 00:01:35,526
dealing with numerous targets. It requires
robust endpoint security and can become

18
00:01:35,526 --> 00:01:39,689
complex in dynamic environments,
